WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.467 --> 00:00:11.209
Next weekend is my Grandma's birthday party.

2
00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:18.450
I get to play with my cousins all day!

3
00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:26.222
Bada: Dad! Dad! Why is there a big circle around that number on the calendar?

4
00:00:26.223 --> 00:00:27.590
Bada: What is it?

5
00:00:27.591 --> 00:00:28.993
Dad: Let me see.

6
00:00:28.994 --> 00:00:31.942
Oh, that's Grandma's birthday.

7
00:00:31.943 --> 00:00:36.666
Dad: This year it falls on a Saturday.

8
00:00:36.667 --> 00:00:39.304
Hana: We will go to see Grandma?

9
00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:43.006
Dad: Of course! Do you like going to Grandma's?

10
00:00:43.007 --> 00:00:48.911
Bada: Sure! I get to see Grandma and play with my cousins.

11
00:00:48.912 --> 00:00:54.302
It's great!

12
00:00:54.303 --> 00:00:57.353
Hana: I love to wear my party dress.

13
00:00:57.354 --> 00:01:00.413
Hana: But it may be too small for me now.

14
00:01:00.414 --> 00:01:03.016
Let me ask Mom.

15
00:01:03.017 --> 00:01:04.918
Bada: How will we get there?

16
00:01:04.919 --> 00:01:07.835
Last time we took the train.

17
00:01:07.836 --> 00:01:09.530
Dad: We will drive.

18
00:01:09.531 --> 00:01:14.073
Bada: But, I want to ride a train, Dad.

19
00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:18.451
Dad: Sorry, Bada. This year we could not buy any tickets.

20
00:01:18.452 --> 00:01:20.232
Bada: Why not?

21
00:01:20.233 --> 00:01:22.483
Dad: They were all sold out.

22
00:01:22.484 --> 00:01:25.375
Bada: Oh boy!

23
00:01:25.376 --> 00:01:28.800
Bada and I are excited.

24
00:01:28.801 --> 00:01:30.822
We love our Grandma.

25
00:01:30.823 --> 00:01:35.513
She is so kind and generous.
